      "AtUnit": "Recon"
     },
     {
      "Type": 0,
      "Lines": [
       {
        "Character": "Placeholder Commander",
        "Text": "Reinforcements at the HQ: a recon car and another squad.",
        "Sound": "",
        "Portrait": 0
       },
       {
        "Character": "Placeholder Scout",
        "Text": "A recon car is fast and sees a long way through the fog. It is armed, and it carries one squad.",
        "Sound": "",
        "Portrait": 1
       },
       {
        "Character": "Placeholder Scout",
        "Text": "Put the new squad in the recon car, then drive it to the front.",
        "Sound": "",
        "Portrait": 1
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "Type": 2,
      "Marker": "Marker",
      "MarkerId": "recon",
      "Text": "Load the squad, then drive east",
      "AtUnit": "Recon"
     }
    ],
    "Side": -2,
    "Count": 2
   },
   {
    "Name": "Scouts aboard",
    "Enabled": true,
    "Condition": 30,
    "Actions": [
     {
      "Type": 3,
      "MarkerId": "recon"
     },
     {
      "Type": 0,
      "Lines": [
       {
        "Character": "Placeholder Scout",
        "Text": "Aboard. A recon car can drive up, shoot, and still put its squad down beside it.",
        "Sound": "",
        "Portrait": 1
       },
       {
        "Character": "Placeholder Commander",
        "Text": "Deal with that lookout. To attack, select a unit, click a lit tile next to the enemy, then click the enemy.",
        "Sound": "",
        "Portrait": 0
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "Type": 2,
      "Marker": "Marker",
      "MarkerId": "lookout",
      "Text": "Attack",
      "AtUnit": "Lookout"
     }
    ],
    "Side": -2,
    "UnitTag": "Scouts"
   },
   {
    "Name": "Out of supply",
    "Enabled": true,
    "Condition": 24,
    "Actions": [
     {
      "Type": 0,
      "Lines": [
       {
        "Character": "Placeholder Commander",
        "Text": "One of our units is out of supply: the ground it stands on is not lit. It will use up its supplies and then lose strength every turn.",
        "Sound": "",
        "Portrait": 0
       },
       {
        "Character": "Placeholder Scout",
        "Text": "Bring it back near the HQ or the supply truck.",
        "Sound": "",
        "Portrait": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "Side": -2,
    "Delay": 1
   },
   {
